ee7d8604e514fde14aa280cdf\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.028268558904528618, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/knn.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Partition the logical point stream statically among OpenMP workers in one parallel region.\", \"Reduce each worker to at most k exact candidates using a private max-heap ordered by distance then original ordinal.\", \"Merge worker candidates through the same deterministic heap and retain the original label-voting behavior.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"cebfd36daf6f4e41\", \"role\": \"B\", \"commit\": \"5c6a6983f6b13c25caee04917cc7cb1af511ddfc\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.028588089781502884, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/knn.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Use stable max-heaps keyed by distance then original encounter ordinal for exact top-k membership under equal distances.\", \"Partition the original encounter order into bounded local heaps, process them with OpenMP when enabled, and serially merge their candidates deterministically.\", \"Separate each contiguous distance block from heap updates and mark its dependency-free loop for OpenMP SIMD/GCC vectorization.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"bb005bff1db54b33\", \"role\": \"B\", \"commit\": \"323dd8c429712fc1a7fad1d921291a398ab440a7\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.028588721218208473, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/knn.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Constrain the independent distance loop to ARM64's four-float SIMD width.\", \"Use the full heap's initial worst distance to skip a distance block only when no later-ordinal candidate can enter that local heap.\", \"Avoid candidate construction for scalar-tail points that cannot improve the current local heap.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"5657d08158b24a00\", \"role\": \"C\", \"commit\": \"a511a41008987b3f80b4c2f29706a45986e7e228\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.17713448405265808, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/knn.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Add an OpenMP point-granular static partition with per-thread bounded top-k workspaces.\", \"Merge local candidate sets by exact (distance, original ordinal) ordering before retaining the existing label-vote behavior.\", \"Retain a serial fallback for non-OpenMP builds, allocation/size guards, and NaN distances.\"]}}]}, \"target_as_data\": {\"architecture\": \"ARM64\", \"cpu_cores\": 4, \"gpus\": 0}, \"required_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"analysis\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"A\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"B\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"C\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"G\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"analysis\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"G\"]}}"
